WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:02.340
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:06.040
We are Pongfinity and welcome to another episode
of Challenge Pongfinity.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:11.080
This is the series where YOU challenge US
with your craziest ideas related to table

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:11.600
tennis.

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:15.240
We will go through all of your comments, pick
the most creative ones and make a video out

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.080
of them.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.040
If your idea gets picked, we will feature
it and give it a shout out.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.420
So make sure to leave your ideas in the comments
below!

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:31.600
Adult Cow wants us to play a 2 min long rally
with the handle of the racket.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.020
We are going to give it 3 tries.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.000
Let's see how it goes.

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:23.650
On our last episode of Challenge Pongfiity
we did 5 consecutive around the net shots.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:27.040
Now Matija Sirovec wants us to do 20.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.640
So, let's do it!

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:31.360
Basic Breik wants us to play a rally with
only 1 racket.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.560
That means we will throw the racket to each
other

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.360
and we will see how many shots we can do.

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:38.420
Let's go!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:55.360
Thanks for watching guys!

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:59.800
If you enjoyed the video leave it a thumbs
up and let's see if we can reach 2.000 likes

00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:00.800
with this video.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:03.479
If you are new to the channel, subscribe right
here

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.680
and watch the previous episodes here!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.900
Until next time!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.420
With only 1 racket...

